   "options": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"font-size:13px;\">\n<b>Two independent limits per designation:</b>\n<ul style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;padding:0;\">\n<li><b>Max Approval Authority</b> \u2014 the largest amount a person of this designation can <b>approve for others</b> (approvals route up <i>Reports To</i> until someone has enough authority).</li>\n<li><b>Max Self Advance</b> \u2014 the largest <b>Employee Advance</b> a person of this designation may hold for themselves.</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">Board of Directors has unlimited approval authority regardless of the amount entered. Designations not listed here fall back to built-in defaults.</div>\n</div>"
